      "description": "# Extend auction window and add rebalance operator for OPEN\n [OPEN Governance Parameters Update - Q2 2026](https://forum.reserve.org/t/open-governance-parameters-update-q2-2026/1528)\n Following the Q2 parameter discussion, this proposal delivers two operational improvements:\n\n 1. Increase auction duration from 30 to 40 minutes — wider bidding windows improve price discovery and reduce slippage during rebalance auctions, benefitting all OPEN holders.\n 2. Add a rebalance operator — extends rebalance execution coverage with a second executor alongside the existing operator, reducing single-point-of-failure risk. The operator contract is immutable and owner-gated.\n\n No change to index methodology, mandate, or fee schedule.",
